## Bulk Action Flow (ProductsPage.tsx)

```
1. User selects rows via checkboxes
   → selectedIds Set updated via handleSelectOne/handleSelectAll

2. BulkActionToolbar displays with count
   → Shows "{N} selected"

3. User clicks action button (e.g., "Delete")
   → handleBulkAction('delete', selectedIds) called

4. Confirmation dialog appears
   → confirm(`Delete ${selectedIds.size} products?`)

5. On confirm:
   → Action placeholder executes
   → Selection cleared
   → Alert shown with result

6. On cancel:
   → No action taken
```

